    "detailed_description": "One simple rule: Eliminate all the red pegs from the game board before running out of balls.<br><br>Pawggle is a casual Peggle/Pachinko style game but, this time, you step away from the visor.<br>Step into a world where you become the guiding hand for your furry companions, aiding them by strategically placing blue pegs.<br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Assist five adorable fur creatures<br></li><li>Conquer a series of challenging levels ensuring you never run out of balls<br></li><li>Exercise your skill and try being number one on the leaderboard</li></ul>    <br>Join the fun and experience the joy of Pawggle as you master the art of the peg!",
